#
# Sec Fan common & chip drivers configuration
#

config SEC_FAN
	tristate "Use external thermistor near AP for checking temperature"
	default n
	help
	  Use sec_fan sub-system for providing sec_fan interface with thermal engine
	  at userspace.

	  Please use the skeleton driver, ic_name-sec_fan.c for writing a new IC driver.

	  Note this is in primitive stage, so multiple device support, etc., are yet to be supported.

config SENSORS_MAX31760_SEC_FAN
	tristate "Maxim MAX31760 Precision fan controller"
	depends on I2C
	help
	  If you say yes here you get support for the Maxim Integrated
	  MAX31760 Precision Fan-Speed Controller with non volatile Look-Up
	  Table with Temperature Sensor.

	  This driver can also be built as a module.  If so, the module
	  will be called max31760.